## Net benefit
Net 25-year benefit is savings minus price.
chart hbar bids x=bidder y=net benefit unit=$ focus="Copperfield Solar" title="Net 25-year benefit"

## Schedule fit
table = Bidder,Complete by,Fit; Copperfield Solar,2027-07-31,Ready; SunHarvest,2027-08-15,Ready; Meridian Renewables,2027-08-31,Ready; Brightline Energy,2027-09-30,Failed; Halcyon Power,2027-10-31,Failed
!! Brightline Energy and Halcyon Power would finish after the school year starts on 2027-09-01.

## Recommendation
We recommend **Copperfield Solar**. It has the highest net benefit, $265,000 above SunHarvest, and the earliest completion, 2027-07-31.
!! Copperfield also has the **highest upfront price, $2,875,000**, which the district must finance.
